<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cansoria Studio Order Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #332d28; line-height: 1.6; background: #f7f4ef; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee6dc; }
        .header { border-bottom: 1px solid #eee6dc; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; color: #2d2926; }
        .details { background: #f7f2ec; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .details p { margin: 5px 0; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #8a8178; text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Your artwork order is confirmed</h1>
        </div>
        <p>Hi there,</p>
        <p>We have received your Cansoria Studio order and are preparing the details for production.</p>

        <div class="details">
            <p><strong>Order ID:</strong> {{id}}</p>
            <p><strong>Total Amount:</strong> {{total}}</p>
        </div>

        <p>You will receive updates as your artwork moves through studio review, production, and shipping.</p>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; Cansoria Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
